cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Augur in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Augur: Launch Foresight for Makers"
abstract: "Augur is an open-source causal engine for launch prediction — built for makers, solo brand owners, and small creator teams to rehearse a product or content launch before they spend on it. It combines structural causal models, agent-based simulation with large language model personas, and Hawkes-process diffusion forecasting, behind a platform-agnostic adapter layer with a reference implementation for Xiaohongshu (XHS / RedNote) and extension points for TikTok, Instagram, YouTube Shorts, and Douyin."
type: software
